# Cline entry pointer (Constitution Part 20.2)
#
# No rules live here. They live in AGENTS.md and PROJECT_SKILL.md.
# Forking rules across entry files is how projects drift.

1. Read AGENTS.md, then PROJECT_SKILL.md, then .ai/READ_FIRST.md.
2. Run: ./project_tool.sh doctor      (or PROJECT_TOOL.bat doctor on Windows)
3. Run: ./project_tool.sh map context --task "<your task>" --budget 4000
4. Read .ai/CONTEXT_PACK.md and .ai/CURRENT_STATE.md.
5. Open only the files the task router named. Do not scan the repository.
6. Never invent business meaning — write PENDING_APPROVAL and ask (Part 41).
7. Before "done": map verify, architecture verify --source-scan,
   constitution audit, memory validate, gates status.
